Z||000007||StuGood||10-31-2001||06:32 PM||||Well, congratulations, Cheever!  If it means anything, I've never replaced an alternator on a Fiero.  Never had to.  When my time comes, I'll probably be asking you for advice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>It's a great feeling to pull something off the car, and when you look at it, it's <B>obvious</B> you weren't wasting your time   (I'm talking about the bad bearings you found).  I call it that "Aha-!" feeling.  Way to go  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
